[
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P1-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P1-S1",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Being a man has always been dangerous.",
    "translation": "作为一个男人一直都是危险的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P1-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P1-S2",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "There are about 105 males born for every 100 females, but this ratio drops to near balance at the age of maturity, and among 70-year-olds there are twice as many women as men.",
    "translation": "大约每 100 名女性出生就有 105 名男性，但这一比例在成熟时下降到接近平衡，并且在 70 岁的老年人中，女性数量是男性的两倍。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P1-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P1-S3",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "But the great universal of male mortality is being changed.",
    "translation": "但男性死亡率的普遍现象正在发生改变。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P1-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P1-S4",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Now, boy babies survive almost as well as girls do.",
    "translation": "现在，男婴的生存率几乎和女婴一样好。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P1-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P1-S5",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "This means that, for the first time, there will be an excess of boys in those crucial years when they are searching for a mate.",
    "translation": "这意味着，在寻找伴侣的关键年份，男孩数量将首次出现过剩。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P1-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P1-S6",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "More importantly, another chance for natural selection has been removed.",
    "translation": "更重要的是，自然选择的另一个机会被消除了。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P1-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P1-S7",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Fifty years ago, the chance of a baby (particularly a boy baby) surviving depended on its weight.",
    "translation": "五十年前，婴儿（尤其是男婴）的生存机会取决于其体重。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 8,
      "ps": "P1-S8"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 8,
      "id": "P1-S8",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "A kilogram too light or too heavy meant almost certain death.",
    "translation": "太轻或太重一公斤几乎都意味着死亡。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P2-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P2-S1",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Today it makes almost no difference.",
    "translation": "今天，这几乎没有什么区别。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P2-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P2-S2",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Since much of the variation is due to genes, one more agent of evolution has gone.",
    "translation": "由于大部分变异是由基因造成的，因此又一个进化的推动者消失了。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P2-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P2-S3",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "There is another way to commit evolutionary suicide: stay alive, but have fewer children.",
    "translation": "进化自杀还有另一种方式：保持活力，但少生孩子。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P2-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P2-S4",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Few people are as fertile as in the past.",
    "translation": "很少有人像过去一样生育能力强。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P2-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P2-S5",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Except in some religious communities, very few women have 15 children.",
    "translation": "除了一些宗教团体外，很少有女性拥有 15 个孩子。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P2-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P2-S6",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Nowadays the number of births, like the age of death, has become average.",
    "translation": "如今，出生人数和死亡年龄一样，已趋于平均。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P2-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P2-S7",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Most of us have roughly the same number of offspring.",
    "translation": "我们大多数人的后代数量大致相同。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 8,
      "ps": "P2-S8"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 8,
      "id": "P2-S8",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Again, differences between people and the opportunity for natural selection to take advantage of it have diminished.",
    "translation": "人与人之间的差异以及自然选择利用这种差异的机会再次减少。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P3-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P3-S1",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "India shows what is happening.",
    "translation": "印度展示了正在发生的事情。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P3-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P3-S2",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "The country offers wealth for a few in the great cities and poverty for the remaining tribal peoples.",
    "translation": "这个国家为大城市中的少数人提供了财富，却为剩下的部落人民提供了贫困。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P3-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P3-S3",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "The grand mediocrity of today—everyone being the same in survival and number of offspring—means that natural selection has lost 80% of its power in upper-middle-class India compared to the tribes.",
    "translation": "今天的巨大平庸——每个人的生存和后代数量都一样——意味着与部落相比，自然选择在印度中上层阶级中失去了 80% 的力量。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P3-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P3-S4",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "For us, this means that evolution is over; the biological Utopia has arrived.",
    "translation": "对我们来说，这意味着进化已经结束；生物乌托邦已经到来。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:3f9a5388ad11097f9557bbf5154a5917cfd6524a94745a49b350362d9a74b695"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P3-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P3-S5",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Strangely, it has involved little physical change.",
    "translation": "奇怪的是，它几乎没有带来任何物理变化。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2000.js",
      "year": 2000,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2000-r-t2",
