    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 10,
      "id": "P3-S10",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "But however amazed our descendants may be at how far from Utopia we were, they will look just like us.",
    "translation": "但是，无论我们的后代对我们离乌托邦有多远感到惊讶，他们看起来都会像我们一样。",
